export const HOW_HTML = `<div class="eyebrow">magic-carpet-chat · HEAD 3bf9877</div><h1 class="t">How it's built</h1><div class="sub">two threads, one door, one keychain</div>
<p>A gpui-kit window on one thread; nostr-sdk and reqwest on a second thread with its own tokio runtime; two unbounded channels between them. The Chat pane alone streams on the window's executor. Every DList, claim and profile update leaves through <code>POST /api/strfry/publish</code>. Keys sit in the macOS keychain under <code>magic-carpet-chat</code>. The app never pays: the server's auto-pay watcher does, and this app polls its rows.</p>
<h3 class="sec">Filesystem</h3><pre>${META.filesystem}</pre>
<h3 class="sec">Environment</h3><pre>MC_ISSUER_NSEC / MC_CLAIMANT_NSEC   keys, win over the keychain
MC_ISSUER_NPUB                     whose bounties to list when no issuer key is stored
MC_RELAY_URL / MC_BASE_URL         rehearsal overrides
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY                  or ~/.config/anthropic/key</pre>`;
